e back then?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sanaya","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Susan","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why are you asking?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander's question puts Susan on alert. She tilts her head and looks up at them, puzzled."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I just remembered—it might've been mine."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sanaya","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Susan","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh? But I already burned it."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sanaya","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Did you open it? What was inside?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sanaya","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Susan","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No, I didn't... Was it something important? I didn't mess anything up, did I?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sanaya","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No, nothing important. Just a letter from a friend."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Sanaya","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Susan","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh no... I'm so sorry. I should've checked before burning it!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Susan stomps her foot in frustration. The Commander gently pats her head in reassurance."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text"